  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "For a concert, the ticket price is determined by reversing all bits of a given 32-bit unsigned integer NNN. Each bit in the original number should be reversed in position (first bit becomes last, second becomes second-last, and so on).\n\n\nInput Format\n\nFirst line contains TTT, number of test cases\nNext TTT lines each contain a single integer NNN\n\n\nOutput Format\n\nFor each test case, print the number obtained after reversing all bits.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤51 \\leq T \\leq 51≤T≤5",
      "0≤Lengthoflist≤1050 \\leq Length of list \\leq 10^50≤Lengthoflist≤105",
      "1≤Nodevalue≤1091 \\leq Node value \\leq 10^91≤Nodevalue≤109",
      "−1-1−1 marks end of input"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "",
    "outputFormat": "",
    "notes": [],
